  _onInteracted: {fileID: 0}
  _noteTitle: "Father's Journal \u2014 Last Entry"
  _noteText: "The humming comes from below. I sealed the study door the only way
    the old books describe.\n\nThree candles guard the seal. On the night it worked,
    only the FIRST and the THIRD flame burned. The middle one must stay dark \u2014
    it always must.\n\nIf anyone ever undoes this... God forgive them."
  _sanityOnFirstRead: -5
